   "stem_html": "Convert the Babylonian number <br><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"exercises/media/911b633ad5b1144d.png\" alt=\"Babylonian numeral 11 is displayed.\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"exercises/media/502cb642deafd99e.png\" alt=\"Babylonian numeral 42 is displayed.\"> <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"exercises/media/dde8cd8015def1fb.png\" alt=\"Babylonian numeral 16 is displayed.\"> <br>into a Hindu-Arabic number.",
