     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>This is a three-digit number.</p>\n<p>The first digit: 11</p>\n<p>The second digit: 42</p>\n<p>The third digit: 16</p>\n<p>11(60<sup>2</sup>) + 42(60) + 16 = 42,136</p>"
    },
